WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.528
Open Custom Variables in the editor sidebar

00:00:04.528 --> 00:00:08.929
Type a name: it becomes lowercase snake_case

00:00:08.929 --> 00:00:13.037
Click Add; the list saves at once

00:00:13.037 --> 00:00:16.811
Sort the list alphabetically

00:00:16.811 --> 00:00:24.699
Use it in the prompt: type @ and pick it

00:00:24.699 --> 00:00:28.991
Click Save

00:00:28.991 --> 00:00:31.753
Each call fills the chip with that call's value

00:00:31.753 --> 00:00:36.253
Test assistant shows a field per variable

00:00:36.253 --> 00:00:38.863
Campaign CSVs and the API fill them for real calls
